---
// OneStopCallout.astro
---

<section class="bg-[#1c1917] text-[#fffdf8] py-24 md:py-32 border-t border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)]">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
      {/* Visual Container with true interior-to-terrace opening */}
      <div class="aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-[5/4] lg:col-span-7 overflow-hidden border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] bg-black/40">
        <img 
          src="/images/p8-interior-living.png" 
          alt="Modern custom living room opening to outdoor reflection pool terrace in Houston" 
          class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 hover:scale-105" 
          loading="lazy" 
        />
      </div>

      {/* Copy Column */}
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#dfc8a7]"></span>
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#dfc8a7]">Design-Build Integration</p>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-heading mt-4 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-[#fffdf8] leading-tight">
          Designed with architectural restraint. Engineered for permanence.
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 h-px w-12 bg-[#8c6d46]"></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base text-[#dfd7ca] leading-relaxed">
          Custom home projects derail when architectural intent, municipal codes, and trade procurement are kept in silos. Saadi Construction Group bridges this gap by unifying architecture, structural engineering, permit expedition, and master craftsmanship under a single point of accountability.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a 
            href="/contact" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#8c6d46] px-7 py-3.5 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#fffdf8] transition hover:bg-[#a68254]"
          >
            Start Your Project Consultation
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
